Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 右側肩窩處(缺盆)持續擴散，可見數個淋巴腫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→故4/30方加生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 但痛減"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 按壓腫塊處，無拒按現象"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 睡時自覺身不熱(但其女說她熱)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 足夜溫日涼"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 可平躺睡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 左手臂痠麻以致睡不著"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 口渴有，喜涼飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 胃口，會餓"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 手仍冷些"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：\n2、身體："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽氣仍無法完全運行"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 針同前穴"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data